---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ASSETS } from '../data/assets';
const links = [['/guides/','Browse gameplay guides'],['/release-date/','Platforms and buying decisions'],['/download/','Get the full game'],['/guides/walkthrough/','Plan your progression'],['/guides/best-skills-guide/','Catalysts and upgrade decisions'],['/multi-enemy-positioning-threat-control/','Control multiple enemies'],['/pc-stutter-after-halloween-update/','Diagnose PC problems'],['/demo/','Read the historical Demo archive']];
---
<Layout title="Valor Mortis Guide — Combat, Progression and Released Platforms" description="An independent Valor Mortis fan guide to the released game: combat practice, progression planning, platform choices, installation and the historical Demo." pageType="home">
<div class="container py-10"><p class="section-kicker">Independent fan guide · Available now</p><h1 class="section-title">Valor Mortis: prepare the next encounter</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg text-fog">Valor Mortis was released on October 13, 2026. Plan a route, practice a defensive response or diagnose a technical problem using the guide for that task. This site is independent of One More Level and Lyrical Games.</p><img class="mt-8 rounded-xl" src={ASSETS.hero.src} alt={ASSETS.hero.alt} width="1920" height="1080" /><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="section-title">Choose your next step</h2><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">{links.map(([href,label]) => <li class="rounded-xl border border-brass/20 p-5"><a class="text-brass-bright underline" href={href}>{label}</a></li>)}</ul></section><section class="mt-10 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="section-title">Combat and exploration belong together</h2><p class="mt-4 text-fog">The game follows William, a soldier of Napoleon’s Grande Armée brought back from a battlefield grave. Its first-person encounters combine melee weapons, firearms and supernatural power with parries, dashes and finishers. Interconnected exploration makes route learning and movement part of the same decision as choosing an attack.</p><p class="mt-4 text-fog">The guides distinguish documented patch changes, dated player reports and editorial practice advice. No guide here promises a universal damage formula, an unrecorded benchmark or a complete pickup route where the evidence does not establish one. Read the <a href="/editorial/" class="underline">editorial policy</a> for those boundaries.</p><p class="mt-4 text-fog">The released game and the old Demo are separate products. The Demo archive is historical reference material, not an unofficial installer or a promise that Demo progress transfers. Use the installation guide to reach official stores for your platform.</p></section></div>
</Layout>
